     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "Jeeter Pop-Up at Cape Cod Cannabis!"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Join the event in Wellfleet this Thursday, August 13, 2026, from 4:00 PM to 6:00 PM for a brand pop-up with Jeeter. Meet brand representatives to learn about their products, including their pre-rolls and vape cartridges, and access brand-specific merchandise. Whether interested in the brand’s history or looking for information on their current offerings, this session provides an opportunity to engage with brand experts.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "Visit Cape Cod Cannabis at 1446 State Hwy Route 6 this Thursday to learn more about Jeeter."
    },
